  <symbol id="i-compass" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M16.2 7.8l-2.1 6.3-6.3 2.1 2.1-6.3z"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-grid" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-layers" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l9 5-9 5-9-5zM3 12l9 5 9-5M3 17l9 5 9-5"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></symbol>
</svg>

<!-- ============ NAV ============ -->
<header class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="brand">
      <img src="/assets/logo/logo-delead-dark.png" alt="De' Lead International">
      <span>DLI Education</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="/students">Students</a>
      <a href="/professionals">Professionals</a>
      <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
      <a href="#outcomes">Outcomes</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      <a class="nav-back" href="https://deleadint.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">De' Lead International &nearr;</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-magenta nav-desk" href="https://deleadint.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">De' Lead &nearr;</a>
      <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#contact">Enquire</a>
      <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <h1 class="h1">Build Real Skills.<br>Have Real Fun.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Mentor-led courses in coding, AI and robotics for students, plus future-skills training for working professionals. Online, offline, camps and workshops.</p>
    <div class="hero-paths">
      <a class="hp-students" href="/students">For students
        <svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
      <a class="hp-pros" href="/professionals">For professionals
        <svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-cols">
      <div class="hero-intro">
        <h3><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rocket"/></svg> Hands-on from day one</h3>
        <p>Every track runs on a real project and a mentor per learner, not a slide deck. Concepts come from the build.</p>
        <div class="avatars"><span>DL</span><span>AI</span><span>PY</span><span>3D</span><span>+</span></div>
        <div class="hi-count">2,000+ learners trained</div>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero-figure">
        <svg class="squiggle" viewBox="0 0 220 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M14 224c-4-48 26-84 70-84 40 0 58 44 22 66-30 18-70-8-46-44 20-30 74-40 128-96" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <img src="/assets/photos/session-6.webp" alt="Students in a DLI Education session">
        <span class="photo-tag pt-1">Mentor-led</span>
        <span class="photo-tag pt-2">Real projects</span>
      </figure>

      <div class="hero-aside">
        <div class="hero-blobs"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <p>We believe anyone can code. Every course is built around making something real, then keeping the lesson long after the class ends.</p>
        <a href="#courses" class="btn">Get started
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H8M17 7V16"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ AUDIENCES ============ -->
<section class="section" id="audiences">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead simple reveal">
      <span class="kicker">Who it's for</span>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:10px">Two paths, one hands-on method</h2>
      <p class="sh-note">Pick the track that fits. Same build-first approach, scaled to the learner.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="apath reveal">
      <a class="apath-card students" href="/students">
        <div class="apath-photo"><img src="/assets/photos/session-4.webp" alt="Students building projects"></div>
        <span class="apath-badge">For students</span>
        <h3>Technology courses, ages 7 to college</h3>
        <p>Python, web, robotics, 3D design, data, Gen AI and block coding. Real projects, a mentor per learner, a certificate at the end.</p>
        <ul><li>11 course tracks</li><li>Group or 1-to-1</li><li>Online, offline, camps</li></ul>
        <span class="btn btn-dark">Explore student courses
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H8M17 7V16"/></svg></span>
      </a>
      <a class="apath-card pros" href="/professionals">
        <div class="apath-photo"><img src="/assets/photos/session-3.webp" alt="A professional cohort"></div>
        <span class="apath-badge">For professionals</span>
        <h3>Future skills for educators, HR and institutions</h3>
        <p>Design thinking, leadership, communication, an entrepreneurial mindset and applied Gen AI for the way your team actually works.</p>
        <ul><li>6 skill areas</li><li>Cohort or 1-to-1</li><li>Schools, colleges, teams</li></ul>
        <span class="btn btn-dark">Explore professional tracks
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H8M17 7V16"/></svg></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ HOW WE TEACH ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead reveal">
      <div><span class="kicker">How it works</span><h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:10px">Learning in 3 simple ways</h2></div>
      <div class="deco" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-sparkles"/></svg></div>
      <p class="sh-note">We pair expertly built content with real projects and per-learner mentorship, so skills actually stick.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tgrid c3">
      <article class="tcard lime reveal">
        <h3>Build something real</h3>
        <p>Each course ends with a working thing: an app, a site, a model, a robot. The theory is taught through the build.</p>
        <div class="tc-photo"><img src="/assets/photos/session-4.webp" alt="Students building projects on laptops"></div>
      </article>
      <article class="tcard lav reveal">
        <h3>Learn with a mentor</h3>
        <p>Small groups or 1-to-1, with a mentor guiding each learner. Progress is tracked per person, not per class.</p>
        <div class="tc-photo"><img src="/assets/photos/session-2.webp" alt="A mentor-led class in session"></div>
      </article>
      <article class="tcard rose reveal">
        <h3>Go any format</h3>
        <p>Online, offline at a centre, inside a residential camp, or as a corporate workshop. Same curriculum, your room.</p>
        <div class="tc-photo"><img src="/assets/photos/session-1.webp" alt="An in-person DLI Education session"></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ WHAT THEY'LL LEARN (bento) ============ -->
<section class="section" id="learn">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead simple reveal">
      <h2 class="h2">What they'll learn</h2>
      <p class="sh-note">Two audiences, one hands-on method. Every track is designed to be built, not just watched.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bento reveal">
      <article class="tcard peach b-wide">
        <span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-code"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Coding &amp; Web</h3>
        <p>Python programming, web development and the Internet of Things, from first line to deployed.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tcard rose">
        <span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-sparkles"/></svg></span>
        <h3>AI &amp; Data</h3>
        <p>Gen AI for smart learning, AI for all, Python for data analytics and dashboards.</p>
      </article>
      <div class="b-photo"><img src="/assets/photos/session-4.webp" alt="Students building projects"></div>
      <article class="tcard lav">
        <span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-palette"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Design</h3>
        <p>3D modelling and rendering, plus UI/UX from research to a clickable prototype.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tcard lime b-wide">
        <span class="tc-ico"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-bot"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Robotics &amp; Kids</h3>
        <p>Build and program robots, and block coding that is an early gateway for younger learners.</p>
      </article>
      <div class="b-photo"><img src="/assets/photos/session-5.webp" alt="An IoT dashboard session"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FEATURED TRACKS ============ -->
<section class="section" id="courses">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead reveal">
      <div><h2 class="h2">Featured tracks</h2></div>
      <div class="deco" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></div>
      <p class="sh-note">A snapshot of the student catalogue. Full modules and outcomes live on the Students page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="filters reveal">
      <span class="filter active">All</span>
      <span class="filter">AI &amp; Data</span>
      <span class="filter">Coding &amp; Web</span>
      <span class="filter">Design</span>
      <span class="filter">Robotics &amp; Kids</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cgrid reveal">
      <article class="ccard">
        <div class="cc-top lime"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-code"/></svg></div>
        <div class="cc-rate">Level: <b>Beginner</b></div>
        <h4>Python Programming</h4>
        <p class="cc-desc">Core fundamentals, problem solving, data structures, file and exception handling.</p>
        <p class="cc-meta">Ages 12+ &bull; Group or 1-to-1</p>
        <div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">32 hrs</span><a href="students/index.html#catalogue" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">See details</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ccard">
        <div class="cc-top peach"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-chart"/></svg></div>
        <div class="cc-rate">Level: <b>Intermediate</b></div>
        <h4>Python for Data Analytics</h4>
        <p class="cc-desc">Statistics, data management, exploratory analysis, visualisation and capstone projects.</p>
        <p class="cc-meta">Ages 14+ &bull; 4 to 5 months</p>
        <div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">48 to 60 hrs</span><a href="students/index.html#catalogue" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">See details</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ccard">
        <div class="cc-top rose"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></div>
        <div class="cc-rate">Level: <b>Beginner</b></div>
        <h4>Web Development</h4>
        <p class="cc-desc">HTML, CSS and Bootstrap, JavaScript and jQuery, frameworks and deployment.</p>
        <p class="cc-meta">Ages 12+ &bull; Group or 1-to-1</p>
        <div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">32 to 48 hrs</span><a href="students/index.html#catalogue" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">See details</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ccard">
        <div class="cc-top teal"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-bot"/></svg></div>
        <div class="cc-rate">Level: <b>Beginner</b></div>
        <h4>Robotics</h4>
        <p class="cc-desc">Electronics and sensors, mechanical design and robot programming, geared to STEM pathways.</p>
        <p class="cc-meta">Ages 10+ &bull; 3 to 4 months</p>
        <div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">32 hrs</span><a href="students/index.html#catalogue" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">See details</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ccard">
        <div class="cc-top lav"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-box"/></svg></div>
        <div class="cc-rate">Level: <b>Beginner</b></div>
        <h4>3D Design &amp; Modeling</h4>
        <p class="cc-desc">Modelling fundamentals, sculpting, texturing and rendering for product and architecture.</p>
        <p class="cc-meta">Ages 12+ &bull; 3 to 4 months</p>
        <div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">32 hrs</span><a href="students/index.html#catalogue" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">See details</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="ccard">
        <div class="cc-top lime"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-sparkles"/></svg></div>
        <div class="cc-rate">Level: <b>All levels</b></div>
        <h4>Gen AI for Smart Learning</h4>
        <p class="cc-desc">AI study techniques, prompt engineering, memory and revision tools, ethical use.</p>
        <p class="cc-meta">Ages 13+ &bull; Group or 1-to-1</p>
        <div class="cc-foot"><span class="cc-price">2 months</span><a href="students/index.html#catalogue" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">See details</a></div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:26px" class="reveal"><a class="tlink" href="/students">See all 11 student courses
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H8M17 7V16"/></svg></a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ OUTCOMES ============ -->
<section class="section" id="outcomes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead simple reveal">
      <span class="kicker">Proof</span>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:10px">What learners go on to do</h2>
      <p class="sh-note">A few of the students who started in a DLI Education classroom.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ogrid reveal">
      <figure class="ocard">
        <div class="o-top"><span class="o-badge">EV</span><div><div class="o-name">Evana Eliza Vinoj</div><div class="o-where">Sharjah Indian School, UAE</div></div></div>
        <p class="o-win">Digitised a village library with a Python application. Won the Sharjah Award for Educational Excellence, Distinguished Student, with a Dh30,000 scholarship.</p>
        <span class="o-tag">Python</span>
      </figure>
      <figure class="ocard">
        <div class="o-top"><span class="o-badge">AN</span><div><div class="o-name">Aamil Nazar</div><div class="o-where">GHSS Medical College Campus, Kozhikode</div></div></div>
        <p class="o-win">Built his school's website and was honoured by Kerala's education minister. Two-time winner of the state-level web design competition.</p>
        <span class="o-tag">Web development</span>
      </figure>
      <figure class="ocard">
        <div class="o-top"><span class="o-badge">MA</span><div><div class="o-name">Adhil T S &amp; Ameya M</div><div class="o-where">Kerala, India</div></div></div>
        <p class="o-win">Champions at the TechTop International Bootcamp, held at Kerala Startup Mission's Maker Village, Kochi.</p>
        <span class="o-tag">Robotics</span>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:22px" class="reveal"><a class="tlink" href="students/index.html#heroes">More student stories
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H8M17 7V16"/></svg></a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STATS ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead simple reveal">
      <h2 class="h2">Where DLI Education is so far</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="stats reveal">
      <div class="stat"><b data-count="2000" data-suffix="+">2000+</b><span>Learners trained</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b data-count="11" data-suffix="">11</b><span>Course tracks</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b data-count="4" data-suffix="">4</b><span>Delivery modes</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>India &amp; UAE</b><span>Learners on both sides</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ TESTIMONIAL ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead simple reveal">
      <span class="kicker">In their words</span>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:10px">From the people who took the course</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="qgrid reveal">
      <figure class="qcard">
        <span class="q-m" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
        <blockquote>Being from a non-IT background I thought it would be difficult to learn to code, but De' Lead helped me get the concepts easily, in a fun-filled way.</blockquote>
        <figcaption><b>Soumya C.</b><span>Civil Engineer, on DLI Education</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="qcard">
        <span class="q-m" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
        <blockquote>The instructor was very clear and explained the fundamentals well. The mentor team was always available for clarifications.</blockquote>
        <figcaption><b>[Learner name]</b><span>[Course, year]</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="qcard">
        <span class="q-m" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
